repository-code: 'https://github.com/juheekim-maker/PBPK-Pb-Korean-Cohorts'
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of an extended perinatal physiologically based
  pharmacokinetic (PBPK) model for lead, spanning pregnancy through
  lactation, with grid-quadrature Bayesian calibration against two
  Korean birth cohorts. Includes the corrections to the originally
  submitted implementation documented in the README.
keywords:
  - PBPK
  - lead
  - pregnancy
  - lactation
  - placental transfer
  - Bayesian calibration
